onen</h3>\n    <ul>\n     <li><a href=\"https://www.stiftungbildung.org/foerderfonds-vielfalt/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noindex nofollow\">Link zum Programm</a></li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <aside>\n  <div class=\"prose text-lg space-y-4\">\n   <div>\n    <div class=\"font-bold\">Regionen:</div>\n    <div>Bundesweit</div>\n   </div>\n   <div>\n    <div class=\"font-bold\">Engagementbereiche:</div>\n    <div>\n     <ul>\n      <li>Bildung</li>\n      <li>Kinder und Jugendliche</li>\n      <li>Soziales</li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div>\n    <div class=\"font-bold\">Bewerbungsfrist:</div>\n    <div class=\"mb-1\">Fortlaufende Förderung</div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-5 py-3 border-2 rounded-lg mt-16 px-6 py-6 border-gray\">\n <div class=\"space-y-4 text-lg md:flex flex-row gap-12\">\n  <div class=\"grow\">\n   <h2 class=\"mb-8 font-bold text-2xl\"><a href=\"https://foerderdatenbank.d-s-e-e.de/institutionen/21144-stiftung-bildung\" class=\"link\">Stiftung Bildung</a></h2>\n   <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 grid-flow-row gap-x-8 gap-y-6\">\n    <div>\n     <h3 class=\"font-bold\">E-Mail</h3>\n     <p><a href=\"mailto:foerderanfrage@stiftungbildung.org\">foerderanfrage@stiftungbildung.org</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n     <h3 class=\"font-bold\">Webseite</h3>\n     <p><a href=\"https://www.stiftungbildung.org/\" target=\"_blank\">www.stiftungbildung.org/</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n     <h3 class=\"font-bold\">Telefon</h3>\n     <p>030 80962701</p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"md:w-1/3\">\n   <img class=\"w-full max-w-[360px] mx-auto\" src=\"https://foerderdatenbank.d-s-e-e.de/volumes/profiles/_article_m/Logo-Stiftung-Bildung_klein_transp-1.png.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"249\">\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>";
